WEBVTT

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.490
The months that pass within my dreams

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.410
I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:29.670
If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.130
In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.010
Shangri-la is nowhere to be found

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.810
No one knows the love of the spring wind

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:54.030
The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over

00:00:54.610 --> 00:01:01.990
Trading places, they bloom then wilt

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:05.830
In January, I pick a flower with no petals

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:13.170
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.680
In March, the peach blossoms bloom

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:24.640
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.690
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.780
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.660
Well done, all of you.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:41.990
The first round of the 
preliminaries is over.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:45.740
Thirty-two of you remain.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:50.120
Starting in the next round, 
you'll be competing one-on-one.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:52.660
Draw your lots from the box.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:58.000
The name of your next opponent
will be written on it.

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:03.010
<b>4: 32 Men</b>

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.790
Please draw your lots one at a time.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:10.440
<b>Zen Shidou</b>

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:09.270
Zen Shidou?

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:12.610
Soran, who's your opponent?

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:15.490
Zen Shidou the Aokami, huh?

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:17.310
Bad luck for you.

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:20.690
The guys he faced in the preliminaries 
didn't last one minute against him.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:26.370
The Zen family's Furoku secret art 
suppresses a person's ki vessels.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.870
Oh, speak of the devil.

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.550
He's looking at you, Soran.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.380
He might actually be aware of who you are.

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:39.230
Eshin, Jiun. It's late.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.350
Show the competitors to the inn.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.280
Yes, Reigyoku-sama.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:45.670
You can count on us.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.010
Good.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.330
Farewell.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:48.890
Yes, sir.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:50.240
Hey, Reigyoku-sama.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:53.480
I saw your match today. 
You're really strong.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.780
How over-familiar.

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.290
It's good to see you again, Chou Soran.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.590
You must be exhausted from your match.

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:08.980
You should rest at the inn.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:17.080
Hey, why does Reigyoku-sama hate me so much?

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:21.170
I thought he treated everyone 
that way, but he doesn't.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.720
If anything, he's nice to everyone else.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:28.220
Did I do something to make him hate me?

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:32.060
To be honest, I've been 
wondering about that, too.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:35.550
Normally Reigyoku-sama 
is a very kind person.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:41.440
Maybe he doesn't like the special 
treatment you receive from the Tenshi.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:45.860
You idiot! Reigyoku-sama 
is not such a small man!

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:50.540
Chou Soran can't help it, but I can't believe 
you don't understand Reigyoku-sama!

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:54.130
Really? Then why don't you tell me why?

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.260
Now I've done it.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:02.710
Reigyoku-sama isn't unfriendly to 
you because he doesn't like you.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:05.330
It's because he's jealous of you.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.540
Jealous?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:11.590
So he <i>is</i> jealous of the Tenshi's 
special treatment of him!

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.120
Of course not!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:15.410
It's not because of the Tenshi.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.840
It's your Raihou.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:21.360
Raihou? But he can use Raihou, too.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:25.570
Do you remember the difference between 
your Raihou and Reigyoku-sama's?

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.640
His was black!

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.160
That's right.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.630
That's known as ingorai.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.770
For generations, the Tenshi have passed 
down their Raihou to their disciples.

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:44.640
But the conditions for learning 
the Raihou are very strict.

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:49.090
One of the conditions is to be untainted.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:54.290
Even the most talented men 
are not necessarily pure.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:05:02.090
So the Elders worked to develop a Raihou 
that could be used by those who are impure.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:06.090
That is the Ingorai Reigyoku-sama uses.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.530
<b>Ingorai</b>

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:13.570
And the technique you use is 
the legitimate form, Yougorai.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.830
<b>Yougorai</b>

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.530
<i>I see.</i>

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.260
<i>So that's how it is.</i>

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:26.600
<i>Even guys like Reigyoku-sama are doing it.</i>

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.850
<i>Pull yourself together, Chou Soran!</i>

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.960
<i>It's none of your business 
what he gets up to!</i>

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:36.970
Who's there?

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:41.140
Chou Soran, come quickly.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:45.160
Hou-nee, where are we going?

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:49.900
Fuu Shinton told me your next 
opponent is rather strong.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:56.140
You'd probably lose, 
so I took care of him first.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:57.740
Over there.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:05.730
It's okay.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:08.440
I'll only bury him up to 
his neck, so he won't die.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.210
And I'll feed him.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.360
I've already scouted the surroundings, too.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:16.180
Nobody comes here, so don't worry.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:22.390
Everyone calls me stupid, 
but I'm actually smart.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:23.900
I'm so smart, I can't help it.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.930
You're not smart at all, you idiot!

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:29.940
Just how much do you like burying people?

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:32.610
What are we going to do if 
someone finds out about this?

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.360
We won't have time to worry about the match!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.720
That's not a problem.
I just won't admit to it.

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:42.840
I'll clean him off before I release him, 
so there won't be any evidence.

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.970
Hey, are you okay?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.640
I'll untie you immediately.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.120
My plan failed.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.290
Don't mind that idiot.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.190
Let go of me, Chou Soran!

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:56.400
I'm going to teach this 
crazy woman a lesson!

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.390
How dare you attack me 
in my sleep, you coward?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.810
Come! I will show you 
the power of the Aokami!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.240
Now, now...

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:10.480
Stay out of my way, 
or I'll fight you, as well.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:13.290
Please, calm down.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.580
I have an idea.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.320
What do you mean?

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.850
Well, you see...

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.100
Hey, Houhou and Soran.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.770
Why do you look so tired?

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.910
I'm more than tired.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.510
I didn't get a wink of sleep last night.

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.000
Everyone!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.310
The second round will now begin.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:47.760
Matches will be held simultaneously 
in four separate arenas.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:52.610
All matches will be broadcast 
on these monitors.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.740
They have four arenas?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.570
The first matches will begin shortly!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.450
<b>Ouya VS Tetsu Baryuu</b>

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.130
Ouya versus Tetsu Baryuu!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.960
<b>Riku Rinron VS Kumo</b>

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.950
Riku Rinron versus Kumo!

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.460
<b>Fuu Saen VS Tsuu Kinka</b>

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.460
Fuu Saen versus Tsuu Kinka!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.750
Hey, it's my sister.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:07.750
Sairoku versus Rei!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:11.500
Let the matches begin!

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.510
<i>She hit me here?</i>

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.770
<i>Then I should move farther away.</i>

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:31.670
You seem to be familiar with my power.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:33.940
Are you trying to determine my range?

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:37.190
You got me. Was it that obvious?

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:40.540
You don't need to waste your 
time on that. I'll tell you.

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:45.620
You're right. My power has a limited range.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:48.750
But as long as you're inside this arena,

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:51.510
I'll hit you no matter where you are!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.740
Looks like another easy win for my sister.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:54.280
Rinron!

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:54.710
Hey!

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:55.940
Rinron!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:56.330
Hey!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:59.250
Rinron is the best! Rinron is the strongest!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.390
<b>Rinron LOVE</b>

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.190
We love you, Rinron-chan!

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:05.300
Rinron is the best! Rinron is the strongest!

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.770
That Zouryuu...

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.200
Rinron is the best!

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.760
<i>I'll beat the crap out 
of him after this match.</i>

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.010
I-I'm sorry, Kumo-san!

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:14.960
I didn't ask them to come! 
They came on their own!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.480
I don't care about that.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.690
Admit your defeat, Riku Rinron.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.490
I can't do that.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:26.420
I decided to participate in this 
tournament to test my strength.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.930
Give me everything you've got.

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:32.080
I don't want to fight you, little girl.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.900
Who are you calling "little girl"?

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.340
Call her the all-powerful and 
adorable Rinron-sama, you jerk!

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.850
<i>I'll kill the fatty first.</i>

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.520
Shut up, you idiot!

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:43.130
Stop interfering with my match!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:48.040
Did you hear that?

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.750
Rinron-chan spoke to me!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:53.990
She even nicknamed me "idiot"!

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:57.300
Don't call me Zouryuu anymore. 
Call me "Idiot" from now on.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.050
Got it? I'm "Idiot."

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.630
I'll ask one last time.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.030
Admit defeat.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.410
I refuse!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.200
We haven't even fought yet!

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.000
You wish to become rust on my ryoutenshaku?

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.790
Yes. Show me your strength.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.250
Huh?

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:24.150
Fine. I surrender.

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.900
What? B-But why?

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.680
Kumo-san, wait.

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:31.700
Are you saying I'm not even worth fighting?

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:34.410
Your strength is irrelevant.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:40.620
I swore I would never strike a woman.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.910
Riku Rinron wins!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.910
Seriously?

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.490
I know she's cute, but 
why would he surrender?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:50.510
That's Riku Rinron.

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:53.130
She's the great-granddaughter 
of Elder Rikukin-sama.

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:56.930
She's popular and has a 
lot of passionate fans.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:01.960
Zouryuu fell in love at first sight 
at a meeting held by Rikukin-sama.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:05.100
He's been collecting pictures 
of her ever since.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:10.880
Not bad.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.670
You're blocking my attacks by 
enveloping your body in ki.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:16.060
But how about this?

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:18.780
<i>She dodged it.</i>

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:22.310
<i>An act of desperation?</i>

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:25.920
<i>With her left leg as her center of gravity,</i>

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:28.000
<i>she's generating power through her hips</i>

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.460
<i>and swinging her upper arm 
at a 45 degree angle.</i>

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.420
<i>Based on the 46 blows she's thrown thus far,</i>

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.050
<i>her fist should appear in 
one of three locations.</i>

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:40.820
<i>Even I should be quick 
enough to react to that!</i>

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.550
<i>She dodged again... That's impossible.</i>

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:48.470
What's wrong? You're backing off.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.550
Kinka, was it?

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.550
I underestimated you.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:12:00.950
<i>If we continue fighting, 
my chances of winning are 37%.</i>

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:07.770
<i>But the odds that the damage I suffer 
will affect future missions are 100%.</i>

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.020
I surrender.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:11.210
Huh?

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.780
Wait! You're running away?

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:16.340
But things were just starting 
to get interesting!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:20.180
What's going on? Why did Kinka surrender?

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:23.410
They call her the Living Computer.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:27.420
She must have concluded that there 
was no point in continuing to fight.

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:29.760
What is it?

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:32.260
It's Ouya-san's match.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:42.270
Not even your Taikyoku Unsuu 
can defeat my Tsuuhi Kongou!

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.030
I see.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:54.950
The Tsuuhi Danshu involves 
firing your ki like bullets.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:13:00.750
But your Tsuuhi Kongou gets its 
bomb-like power through hardness.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:13:01.000
<b>Tsuuhi Kongou</b>

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:04.580
You can even control the 
timing of the explosion.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:09.050
No wonder my softness 
wasn't enough to stop it.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:14.040
Knowing how it works won't help you.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:19.070
My father was once defeated by 
your Taikyoku Unsuu at Butousan.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.770
<b>Taikyoku Unsuu</b>

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:23.990
He trained ever since and 
developed this Tsuuhi Kongou.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.900
<b>Taikyoku Kongou</b>

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:27.700
It's a technique developed 
to defeat the Butou Sect.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.740
<b>Soft methods get the better of brute force</b>

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:31.160
They say soft methods get 
the better of brute force.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:34.420
But it all depends on the 
force of your opponent!

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:38.820
The moment that softness of yours hits 
me again, there'll be another explosion!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:39.590
What?

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:45.060
Impossible! That stance...

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.550
<b>Ranjakubi</b>

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.260
It's Ranjakubi!

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.490
<i>Tai chi shouldn't work against me.</i>

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:53.840
<i>No, he broke it down through brute force.</i>

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:56.370
<i>That's not tai chi.</i>

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.140
What are you laughing about, Sei-nii?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:03.620
I felt sorry for Tetsu Baryuu.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:08.940
The Butousan master probably didn't 
fight him with his full strength.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:12.490
I admire the way he uses 
defeat to motivate himself.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:18.910
But thinking softness is all there is 
to tai chi is a big misunderstanding.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:21.440
Yin and yang become one.

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.920
Soft and hard fuse.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:27.070
That is the true nature of tai chi.

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:29.930
They say Taiji is the source of everything.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:35.930
In other words, tai chi is a style of kung fu 
capable of transforming into limitless power.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:39.310
Using hardness against me is meaningless!

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.490
You've only stopped a single blow!

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:44.600
<i>Take this combination of Tsuuhi 
Kongou and normal attacks!</i>

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:46.520
<i>Let's see you block this!</i>

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.440
<i>What?</i>

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.670
Kinshoutou!

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.660
<b>Kinshoutou</b>

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.170
Senkintsui!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.960
<b>Senkintsui</b>

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:03.840
Surprised?

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:07.430
Tsuuhi Kongou isn't the only kung fu I use.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:10.260
I'm now as immovable as a mountain!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.590
Not bad.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:15.260
Looks like your father taught you well.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:20.220
My hardness is far more powerful than yours.

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:22.050
That didn't even tickle.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:24.890
You don't know when to give up.

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:27.980
Looks like this match has been decided.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.390
Crumble.

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:34.700
You're wasting your time.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:38.950
You're not strong enough 
to defeat my Kinshoutou.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.980
Grovel before my strength.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.250
Tetsu Baryuu, look behind you.

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.020
Shut up, Shokatsu Sei!

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.860
Ouya-dono went easy on you.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.430
Good match.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.190
Ouya wins!

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:12.900
Ouya-san never seems very motivated, 
but he's actually amazing.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:16.380
His techniques seem ordinary at first glance,

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:19.080
but the power he expels from his 
fists is constantly changing.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:22.220
They're on par with my 48 Ultimate 
Techniques of the Monzetsu Fist.

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:23.430
Don't insult tai chi!

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:24.390
What technique is that?

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:25.510
You don't need to know!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:27.430
Looks like they're finished, too.

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:29.980
Sairoku is unconscious!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:32.050
Rei wins!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.820
This concludes the first round of matches.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:38.190
The second round will begin now.

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:39.890
Fuu Houhou versus Ou Niken!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:40.920
I'm up.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.220
We'll go watch your match.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.880
Zouryuu versus Chou Reigyoku!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.070
Will Zouryuu be okay?

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.850
We'd better buy a coffin for the fatty.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:54.560
This match should be easy, though.

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.610
His opponent's an Express Delivery underling.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:17:01.060
Chou Soran's probably the 
only one they're banking on.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.660
Their other participants are 
just here for the numbers.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.080
Numbers, huh?

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:11.670
Hey, miss. You've got a flower 
in your willow-like hair.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.370
A flower in your hair.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.310
Well, don't you look slovenly?

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:17.180
Do you not realize you're a woman?

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.170
I can't believe I'm fighting you.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:22.240
You're my opponent?

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:23.520
Yes, that's right.

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.760
I am Ou Niken.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.010
Let's fight fair and—

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.030
H-Hey! Hey!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:35.050
Stop! The match hasn't started yet!

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:36.570
Th-This is against the rules!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.530
Hey, Fuu Houhou.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.110
Don't you think that's a little unfair?

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:41.900
Why?

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.780
Aren't I here to hit my opponent?

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:48.090
Well, I guess that makes sense.

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:49.200
Keep going, then.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.090
None of you are taking this seriously!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:56.630
You're crude, slovenly, and on top 
of that, you ignore the rules.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:18:01.450
I'll teach you some manners.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:03.100
Special Technique: Nagareniji!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.100
<b>Nagareniji</b>

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:10.130
<i>Unlike the others, I can see his ki clearly.</i>

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:14.530
<i>Its colors are so vivid, too.</i>

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.070
Kishikichou!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:15.940
<b>Kishikichou</b>

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.730
Man Pushes Car With Hand!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:17.450
<b>Man Pushes Car With Hand</b>

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:22.500
What a powerful little girl.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.880
Aoshikichou!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.700
<b>Aoshikichou!</b>

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.410
You won't escape.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.330
<i>I-Impossible!</i>

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:35.380
<i>How can he expel so much ki and control it?</i>

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:42.010
It's completely lacking in power.

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.270
Ou Niken is using his technique already.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:49.370
He expels his ki, instills a suggestion,

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:51.940
and affects his opponent's mental state.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:54.530
His own special style 
of kung fu: nagareniji.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:59.660
Having been exposed to the yellow 
of cowardice and blue of melancholy,

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:03.250
you're in no condition to fight, are you?

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:05.650
Auto-suggestion: Akashikichou!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:05.700
<b>Akashikichou</b>

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:06.870
Red of the berserker!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:11.720
You'll pay for your rudeness, girl!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.830
Your attacks don't hurt.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.170
It's like they're there 
but not at the same time.

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.640
I don't really understand 
it, but it's amazing.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.680
M-My nagareniji was ineffective?

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:30.330
You can't be serious.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:32.710
How could the match be so one-sided?

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:33.770
Who is that girl?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.060
<i>Impossible...</i>

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.740
<i>There's no way this slovenly girl</i>

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:44.490
<i>is strong-willed enough to resist 
the effects of my nagareniji.</i>

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:50.180
<i>Is it possible she's achieved enlightenment?</i>

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:54.510
<i>No, I still have that technique.</i>

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:59.410
<i>Her ki is on my body since 
I suffered an attack.</i>

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:01.080
<i>It's worth a shot.</i>

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:06.380
<i>If I analyze the color of her personality from 
her ki and attack with the opposite color,</i>

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:08.300
<i>it will be twice as effective.</i>

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:12.360
<i>Hana-chan's personality is a 
cool blue, so I use yellow ki.</i>

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:17.430
<i>Kumo is a silent black, so white ki that 
illuminates everything is super effective.</i>

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.610
<i>Come to me, girl.</i>

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:22.420
<i>Show me your color.</i>

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.450
<i>I-Impossible!</i>

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.200
<i>She has no color?</i>

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:34.790
<i>No color... transparent...</i>

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:43.230
<i>Years ago, in order to develop my nagareniji,</i>

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:46.630
<i>I traveled the world gathering 
ki from various people.</i>

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:53.070
<i>One country in particular exacted a horrifying 
punishment on its most heinous criminals.</i>

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.510
<i>Robbed of their human dignity,</i>

00:20:55.510 --> 00:21:02.430
<i>the ki of the now completely invalid 
convicts was all colorless and transparent.</i>

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:09.110
<i>That was not surgery, but a destruction 
of the soul far worse than death.</i>

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:14.480
<i>Of all the punishments I'd 
seen, that was the cruelest.</i>

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:19.180
I surrender, Fuu Houhou.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.580
Really? I'm leaving, then.

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:26.630
<i>If her soul was destroyed 
by artificial means,</i>

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:30.220
<i>then she must not remember anything.</i>

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:36.660
<i>Leaving the body and mind intact 
while erasing only the soul...</i>

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.300
<i>Is this something a human can do?</i>

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:46.490
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:50.450
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:54.540
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:58.460
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:02.590
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:06.680
Cute, cute girl

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:10.550
She has such a calm face

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:14.480
But with her giant shovel, she 
goes from one hill to the next

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:18.060
And fills them with holes

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:22.320
I don’t know where she came from

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:26.150
But if you make her mad, she’ll punch you

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:30.280
She’s always in a daze, 
but she’s terrifying

00:22:30.490 --> 00:22:34.080
She’ll smack you without 
warning if you’re stupid

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:38.210
Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn’t shine

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:42.170
This dignified girl is never scared

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:46.260
She works hard all night burying

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.430
She buries others in order to survive

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:54.680
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:58.560
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:02.440
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:06.530
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:09.280
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t have red peppers...

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:11.620
I don’t, I don’t, I don’t!

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:16.850
I can't believe he got Chou 
Reigyoku to use his Raihou.

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:21.290
I-I wanted to see Rinron-chan before I died.

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:25.360
I-Ideally in a frilly skirt.

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:26.960
Hurry up and die.

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:28.420
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.340
Please fight me, Kumo-san.

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:32.910
Sorry. I don't fight women.

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:33.770
Then you can't fight me—

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:34.350
I'll kill you!

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:35.480
You're so mean!

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.900
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita -
The Outcast</i>, "Kitaigen Style."

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>5: Kitaigen Style</b>

00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:39.360
Don't miss it.
